# Runtime telemetry drop-boxes (session ledgers + auto-flushed DI run logs, user call 2026-07-27)
# Evidence ships curated under qa/ — raw runtime logs never enter the repo.
backend/logs/
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-bench/journeys/runs/

# lesson-bench packages: 60-100KB hydrated lesson dumps, regenerated per /lesson-coverage
# run. 20 pre-existing ones are already committed (left as history, not rewritten) but
# new packages accumulate too fast to review/commit individually going forward.
my-tutoring-app/qa/lesson-bench/packages/

# lesson-planner A/B harnesses (scripts/lesson-planner-*.mjs) each write raw per-lesson
# output to their own scratch directory. Shape-based, not name-based, so a new experiment
# never needs a new line here: only named fixtures/ inputs and written *.md reports survive.
